    modified_response: "I will create the `ParticipantView` component in `src/components/ParticipantView.tsx`. This component serves as the mobile-optimized interface for audience members to vote on active polls in real time and submit, view, and upvote anonymous Q&A questions. It checks local storage to prevent double-voting and handles real-time updates seamlessly."
