    modified_response: "I will create the `ProjectorView` component in `src/components/ProjectorView.tsx`. This view is optimized for fullscreen projector displays or main stage screens. It displays large-scale instructions, a dynamically generated QR code that links directly to the audience join URL, large-format animated bar charts for active polls, and a list of top-voted audience questions for real-time moderation during live Q&A."
