    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Bold Typography\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bold Typography\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"><style>body{background-color:#09090B;color:#FFFFFF;font-family:\'Inter\',\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;width:1024px;height:768px;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}:root{--accent-1:#22D3EE;--accent-2:#818CF8;--accent-3:#F472B6;--accent-4:#FB923C}.container{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;height:100%}.main-content{padding:60px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}.sidebar{background-color:#18181B;border-left:1px solid #27272A;padding:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:40px}.question{font-size:56px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-2px;margin-bottom:60px;max-width:600px}.results-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px}.result-row{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.label-group{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;margin-bottom:4px}.option-name{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;color:#A1A1AA}.percentage{font-size:32px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px}.bar-bg{height:16px;background:#27272A;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden;width:100%}.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:99px}.qr-container{background:white;padding:16px;border-radius:24px;width:240px;height:240px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(34,211,238,0.2)}.qr-mock{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(8,1fr);gap:4px;width:100%;height:100%}.qr-pixel{background:#000;border-radius:1px}.join-code{margin-top:24px;text-align:center}.join-label{font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;color:#71717A;margin-bottom:8px}.code-box{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:4px;color:var(--accent-1)}.footer-meta{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:auto;font-size:14px;color:#71717A;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px}.stat-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.live-indicator{width:8px;height:8px;background:#EF4444;border-radius:50%}</style></head><body><div class=\\\"container\\\"><main class=\\\"main-content\\\"><div class=\\\"logo\\\">Pulse<span style=\\\"color:var(--accent-1)\\\">Live</span></div><h1 class=\\\"question\\\">Which area of our developer experience should we prioritize in Q3?</h1><div class=\\\"results-container\\\"><div class=\\\"result-row\\\"><div class=\\\"label-group\\\"><span class=\\\"option-name\\\">Documentation Search</span><span class=\\\"percentage\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-1)\\\">42%</span></div><div class=\\\"bar-bg\\\"><div class=\\\"bar-fill\\\" style=\\\"width:42%;background:var(--accent-1)\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\"result-row\\\"><div class=\\\"label-group\\\"><span class=\\\"option-name\\\">CI/CD Build Speed</span><span class=\\\"percentage\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-2)\\\">28%</span></div><div class=\\\"bar-bg\\\"><div class=\\\"bar-fill\\\" style=\\\"width:28%;background:var(--accent-2)\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\"result-row\\\"><div class=\\\"label-group\\\"><span class=\\\"option-name\\\">Local Environment Setup</span><span class=\\\"percentage\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-3)\\\">18%</span></div><div class=\\\"bar-bg\\\"><div class=\\\"bar-fill\\\" style=\\\"width:18%;background:var(--accent-3)\\\"></div></div></div><div class=\\\"result-row\\\"><div class=\\\"label-group\\\"><span class=\\\"option-name\\\">Internal Tooling UX</span><span class=\\\"percentage\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent-4)\\\">12%</span></div><div class=\\\"bar-bg\\\"><div class=\\\"bar-fill\\\" style=\\\"width:12%;background:var(--accent-4)\\\"></div></div></div></div><footer class=\\\"footer-meta\\\"><div class=\\\"stat-item\\\"><div class=\\\"live-indicator\\\"></div>LIVE</div><div class=\\\"stat-item\\\">142 PARTICIPANTS</div><div class=\\\"stat-item\\\">POLL: DX-ENG-24</div></footer></main><aside class=\\\"sidebar\\\"><div><div class=\\\"join-label\\\" style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">Scan to Join</div><div class=\\\"qr-container\\\"><div class=\\\"qr-mock\\\"><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\" style=\\\"opacity:0\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div><div class=\\\"qr-pixel\\\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"join-code\\\"><div class=\\\"join-label\\\">Or enter code at pulse.live</div><div class=\\\"code-box\\\">772 101</div></div><div style=\\\"color:#52525B;font-size:11px;text-align:center;line-height:1.5\\\">No registration required.<br>Vote instantly from your device.</div></aside></div></body></html>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
